      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Rung 4 \u2014 OBI, attached from outside\nSame `main.go` as demo 3, built with a plain `go build`. No import, no rewriting, no restart. An agent found the process **by port** and attached with eBPF.\n\n**Open a trace.** You get three spans, not one: a `SERVER` span plus `in queue` and `processing`. No code-level approach produced those \u2014 they come from below your code."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "description": "Same source as demo 3, built plainly. The only new thing anywhere is a sidecar container."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces \u2014 expect 3 spans per request",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"demo4-ebpf\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "description": "Three spans per request. 'in queue' is the wait before the application ran at all, which no in-process SDK can measure."
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 latency",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=\"demo4-ebpf\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
