    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What eBPF still cannot give you\nIt sees `GET /hello` \u2014 the **real path**, not `ServeMux`'s route template. It does not know your framework exists.\n\nIt also cannot know your business context: no tenant, no quote id, no span name you would have chosen. Breadth for free, meaning not included.\n\n*Runs in a Lima VM \u2014 eBPF needs a real Linux kernel with BTF.*"
      },
      "id": 7,
      "description": "What eBPF still cannot give you, however convenient it is."
    }
  ]
}
